WEBVTT

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.770
because lots of people 
are going to watch this on TV,

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:06.760
an idea worth sharing from the one
and only Sundar Pichai?

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.860
SRK: We'll not steal the idea,

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.160
Rather than an idea,
I'll probably tell you,

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.650
I think the most important thing 
for the young generation,

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.825
I see people working very hard,

00:16:20.825 --> 00:16:23.375
my advice would be 
for everyone to slow down.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:28.350
Take the time to figure out something 
you are really passionate about,

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:29.385
'Dil Se',

00:16:29.385 --> 00:16:34.315
find something you want to do
from your heart and focus on that.